{
  "name": "Shield of Ineffable Darkness",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can invoke the power of darkness to punish anyone fool enough to harm you. As a Reaction when a creature you can see damages you, that creature has to make a CON Saving Throw or become Blinded until the end of your next turn.</p><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (a minimum of once). You regain one use when you finish a Short Rest and all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
